# good_slopes_fiber35_rect2

Topic: elementary_number_theory   Node: b586888e455d

Provenance: helper lemma. Normalized two-by-three direction rectangle in the 35-point fiber route to OP-1027, tested in experiment 22003. The trimmed LRAT proof and its interpretation are checked by Lean.

No set of points over the residues modulo 35 contains (0,0) and (1,34) while each of the directions 3, 4, 6, 8, 9, 12, 13, 17, 18, 19, 23, 24, 26, 27, 29, 31, 33 and 34 is both injective and surjective on the set.
-/

